The MIT license above applies to the source code in `code/`.

The thesis document (`paper/`) and presentation (`slides/`) are the author's
academic work, provided for reading and reference.

The data in `data/raw/` are derived from the published tables of the National
Sample Census of Agriculture (NSCA) 2021/22 and district administrative
boundaries, both issued by the National Statistics Office, Government of Nepal.
Rights to the underlying source data remain with their original publisher.
